  "description": "## 1.1.6\n have test application use net10 when version is for silksong (netstandard 2.1)\n\n## 1.1.5\n have tcli in workflows available\n\n## 1.1.4\n fix workflows\n\n## 1.1.3\n don't specify license and readme package path\n correct Or for msbuild\n\n## 1.1.2\n add more workflows: - seperate for nuget package - silksong thunderstore package - hollow knight release package\n make wavlib a tiny bit more as intended won't make a new release until actual stuff has changed\n fix test program\n fix bytesPerSample for weird bps numbers adjust UncompressedConverter & ExtensibleConverter - improve parsing of data - make parsing more generic adjust testing program\n\n## 1.0.12\n don't check after EOS have extensibleconverter check for extraparams adjust testing program\n\n## 1.0.11\n push to nuget\n\n## 1.0.10\n fix pushing?\n\n## 1.0.9\n do set version bump version\n\n## 1.0.8\n fix workflow why versions, why\n (tag: v1.0.7.0) fix workflow\n (tag: v1.0.6.0) add condition\n (tag: v1.0.5.0) bump version\n add workflows\n change license\n improve project file\n Merge branch 'master' of github.com:SFGrenade/WavLib\n currectly load 24bit pcm wav data slightly optimize csproj\n add extensible converter - it's pretty much just pcm, with some extra fields add functionality that converters get access to other chunk data reformat entire solution\n gen package on build\n increase packageversion\n increase version\n Preparations to save RIFF WAVE files - Add backing fields\n Resharper code fixes\n Add comments\n Add `IConverter` interface Add `IeeeFloatConverter` Add `AlawConverter` Add `MulawConverter`\n Improve handling of formats Increase version number\n Add functionality to peek into next chunks Add support for logging callbacks Change `GetSamples` to also use `BinaryReader` Add `Inspect` to fully inspect a wav file Make conversion use `BinaryReader` Fix uncompressed 8bit sample conversion\n Update README\n Initial commit",
